export const posts = [
{
 id:'01-start-with-a-pixel', phase:0, stage:0,
 title:B('Start with your first pixel','从一个像素开始搭建'),
 goal:B('Create the project, run a known milestone, and name who owns every part of the frame.','建立项目，运行确定的里程碑，说清一帧中每个部分由谁负责。'),
 intro:B('A viewer looks like a single application. Inside it are three jobs: the operating system provides a place to draw, the renderer turns data into pixels, and the interface supplies camera and time. We will build those jobs in that order. You do not need to know Gaussian calculus to clear a window.','Viewer 看起来是一个应用，里面其实有三个工作：操作系统提供画布，渲染器把数据变成像素，界面提供相机与时间。我们按这个顺序搭建。不懂 Gaussian 微积分，也能先把窗口清成黑色。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Set up a reproducible starting point','1. 先建立可复现的起点'),[P('Install Git, a current stable Rust toolchain and Node.js LTS. On Windows, Rust also needs the MSVC C++ build tools and Windows SDK. Run the commands below in a terminal. Use the repository lockfiles; this series uses wgpu 30 and winit 0.30, so an older tutorial’s method names may not compile here.','安装 Git、当前稳定版 Rust 和 Node.js LTS。Windows 上 Rust 还需要 MSVC C++ 构建工具及 Windows SDK。下面的命令在终端运行。保留仓库锁文件；本系列使用 wgpu 30 和 winit 0.30，旧教程的 API 名称不一定能编译。'),P('The reference repository already contains every milestone. The stage number selects the behavior you are studying; it is not a separate historical commit. To learn by rebuilding, add the source blocks introduced in each chapter to your own branch, then compare the resulting pixels with the reference lab. Full source snapshots are linked below each block.','参考仓库已经包含所有里程碑，阶段编号用来选择学习的行为，不是不同的历史提交。要边学边重建，可以在自己的分支上逐章加入介绍的代码块，再和参考实验的像素对照。每个片段下面都能打开完整源码快照。')]),
 S(B('2. Learn six Rust words as you meet them','2. 先认识六个会遇到的 Rust 概念'),[P('A struct groups values, like a camera’s position and direction. An impl gives that group methods. &T borrows a value for reading; &mut T borrows it for changing. Option<T> means the value can be absent, such as a window before startup. Result<T, E> means an operation can fail; ? returns the error to its caller instead of silently continuing.','struct 把数据装在一起，例如相机的位置和方向；impl 为它添加方法。&T 表示借用来读取，&mut T 表示借用来修改。Option<T> 表示可能还没有这个值，例如启动前的窗口。Result<T, E> 表示操作可能失败；? 会把错误返回给调用者，而不是带着错误继续。'),P('async/await lets browser GPU initialization finish later without blocking the page. Arc<Window> lets the native app and GPU surface keep shared ownership of the same window. Neither keyword draws anything. They solve lifetime and scheduling problems around the renderer.','async/await 让浏览器在等待 GPU 初始化时继续响应。Arc<Window> 让桌面应用和 GPU surface 共同持有同一个窗口。这些关键字本身不会绘图，它们解决的是渲染器周围的生命周期与调度问题。')]),
 S(B('3. Draw the ownership map before the pixels','3. 先画职责图，再画像素'),[P('The browser host owns a canvas, fetch and requestAnimationFrame. The native host owns a winit window and OS events. Both create a WorkshopSurface. It owns the device, queue and presentation target and calls WorkshopPass. That pass owns shaders and buffers, with no dependency on a DOM or window.','浏览器宿主负责 canvas、fetch 和 requestAnimationFrame；桌面宿主负责 winit 窗口与操作系统事件。两者都创建 WorkshopSurface，由它持有 device、queue 和显示目标，并调用 WorkshopPass。这个渲染 pass 持有 shader 与 buffer，不依赖 DOM 或窗口。'),P('A buffer is GPU memory containing numbers. A shader is a program the GPU runs on those numbers. A render pipeline connects shader entry points to rules such as blending and output format. A command encoder records work; a queue submits it. Keeping these words separate makes a black screen diagnosable.','Buffer 是存放数字的 GPU 内存，shader 是 GPU 用来处理数字的程序。Render pipeline 将 shader 入口与混合、输出格式等规则连接起来。Command encoder 记录工作，queue 提交工作。把这些名词分清，黑屏时才知道该查哪里。')]),
 S(B('4. Your first success is intentionally black','4. 第一张正确的画面就是黑色'),[P('Stage 0 acquires the next surface texture, opens a render pass with LoadOp::Clear(BLACK), stores the result, submits commands and presents it. It issues no geometry draw. In the browser, “Presented frames” must increase while the draw count stays zero. This distinguishes a valid clear operation from a page that never initialized.','阶段 0 获取下一张 surface texture，开启 render pass，用 LoadOp::Clear(BLACK) 清屏，保存结果、提交命令并显示，不调用任何几何绘制。在浏览器里，Presented frames 应递增，而绘制数保持 0。这能区分正常清屏和根本没初始化的页面。')])
 ],
 commands:'git clone https://github.com/pajama-studio/4dgaussian.git\ncd 4dgaussian\ncargo run --locked --example workshop -- 0',
 expected:B('A black native window; the terminal prints the adapter backend. Press 1 to move to the triangle. For the online lab, no local setup is required.','出现黑色桌面窗口，终端打印适配器后端。按 1 进入三角形。在线实验不需要安装环境。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop_surface.rs','frame',B('Read this as acquire → prepare → record → submit → present. Stage 0 skips the draw inside the pass.','按获取 → 准备 → 记录 → 提交 → 显示的顺序读；阶段 0 跳过 pass 内的绘制。'))],
 task:B('Change BLACK to a dark red clear color. Predict which other stages will also get that background before running them.','把 BLACK 改成暗红色。运行前先预测：还有哪些阶段会跟着换背景？'),
 answer:B('Every stage uses this same render pass, so every background changes. A shader edit is unnecessary. If the triangle later appears but the clear color does not, you may be running an old binary or a different host.','所有阶段共用这个 render pass，因此背景都会改变，无需修改 shader。若后面三角形出现但清屏色没变，可能运行了旧二进制或另一个宿主。'), refs:['rust','wgpu'], math:'/learn/01-the-whole-story/'
},
{
 id:'02-window-to-gpu',phase:0,stage:0,title:B('Connect a window to the GPU','把窗口连接到 GPU'),
 goal:B('Initialize both hosts, handle resizing, and follow a frame’s lifetime without confusing a window with a texture.','初始化两个宿主，处理尺寸变化，分清窗口与纹理，追踪一帧的生命周期。'),
 intro:B('A window is a place on the desktop. A surface is the GPU’s connection to that place. The texture you render into changes from frame to frame. Keeping a texture forever is like writing every letter onto yesterday’s envelope.','窗口是桌面上的一个区域，surface 是 GPU 通向这个区域的连接。每帧渲染的 texture 会变。把一张显示纹理永远留着，就像每封信都写在昨天的信封上。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Ask for a compatible device','1. 请求兼容的设备'),[P('Instance discovers graphics backends. Adapter selects a GPU compatible with our surface. Device creates resources; Queue uploads data and submits command buffers. Request the capabilities you need, not every optional feature the GPU exposes. This workshop uses baseline rendering and storage buffers.','Instance 负责发现图形后端，Adapter 选择兼容 surface 的 GPU，Device 创建资源，Queue 上传数据并提交命令缓冲。只请求真正需要的能力，不把 GPU 的全部可选功能都打开。本实验使用基础渲染能力及 storage buffer。'),P('The attachment format is part of a pipeline’s contract. Query the surface formats before creating the pipeline. This series prefers a non-sRGB UNORM format to match the baseline’s numeric RGB convention; production color management needs an explicit source-color decision. Recreating a surface with a different format requires a compatible pipeline.','附件格式是 pipeline 约定的一部分。先查询 surface 支持的格式，再创建 pipeline。本系列优先选非 sRGB 的 UNORM 格式，以匹配基线的 RGB 数值约定；生产色彩管理还需要明确来源色彩空间。新 surface 若换了格式，pipeline 也必须兼容。')]),
 S(B('2. Create the host at the right moment','2. 在合适的生命周期创建宿主'),[P('The native app creates its window inside resumed. It passes an Arc clone into create_surface so the surface can keep the window alive. On desktop only, pollster waits for asynchronous initialization. The browser instead awaits WorkshopRenderer.create(canvas); blocking that event loop would prevent the page from progressing.','桌面应用在 resumed 回调中创建窗口，把 Arc 的克隆传给 create_surface，让 surface 能保持窗口存活。只在桌面启动时使用 pollster 等待异步初始化。浏览器则 await WorkshopRenderer.create(canvas)；阻塞浏览器事件循环会让页面无法继续。'),P('On suspend, the sample drops the native GPU/surface state and window, then reconstructs them on resume. A production app would also preserve UI state and implement device-loss recovery. Here an unrecoverable validation failure stops with an error and a reload path; the lesson does not claim full recovery.','暂停宿主时，示例释放桌面 GPU/surface 状态和窗口，恢复时重建。生产应用还应保存界面状态并实现设备丢失恢复。本实验遇到不可恢复的验证错误会停止、显示错误并允许刷新，不声称已经实现完整恢复。')]),
 S(B('3. Size is measured in two units','3. 尺寸有两套单位'),[P('A canvas may occupy 600 × 400 CSS pixels while its backing texture is 900 × 600 physical pixels at a capped device-pixel ratio of 1.5. Set both canvas dimensions and the surface configuration. Compute the camera aspect ratio from the actual render width and height. Never configure a zero-sized surface while a native window is minimized.','Canvas 可能在界面占 600 × 400 CSS 像素，而在限制为 1.5 的设备像素比下使用 900 × 600 物理像素纹理。Canvas 尺寸与 surface 配置都要更新。相机宽高比取实际渲染宽高。桌面窗口最小化时，不能拿零尺寸配置 surface。')],String.raw`W_{mathrm{render}}=mathrm{round}(W_{mathrm{CSS}}cdot d),\qquad a=W_{mathrm{render}}/H_{mathrm{render}}`),
 S(B('4. Surface errors are different events','4. Surface 错误不是同一种情况'),[P('Outdated or Lost triggers surface reconfiguration; Timeout or Occluded skips this frame. Validation stops the sample and reports the problem. Only a successfully acquired texture gets presented. Notice that wgpu 30 uses queue.present(frame); old code using a different API is not a reason to skip checking the version.','Outdated 或 Lost 时重新配置 surface；Timeout 或 Occluded 时跳过这一帧；Validation 时停止示例并报告问题。只有成功获取的纹理才会被显示。注意 wgpu 30 使用 queue.present(frame)，遇到旧教程的不同 API 时应先检查版本。')])],
 commands:'rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown\ncargo install wasm-pack --locked\nnpm ci\nnpm run dev\n# Open the local URL printed by Wrangler, then /build/lab/?stage=0',
 expected:B('The same clear screen in a native window and browser canvas. Resize each; the reported render resolution should track the backing surface.','桌面窗口与浏览器 canvas 显示相同的清屏。分别调整尺寸，渲染分辨率应随底层 surface 改变。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop_surface.rs','init',B('GPU setup is shared; the host supplies the surface.','GPU 初始化共用，宿主只提供 surface。')),C('examples/workshop.rs','native-create',B('The native window lives outside the pass.','桌面窗口位于渲染 pass 之外。'))],
 task:B('Minimize and restore the native window. Then resize the browser lab to a narrow viewport. Which code should run, and which values must never be zero?','最小化并恢复桌面窗口，再把浏览器实验改成窄窗口。哪些代码应该执行，哪些配置值不能为零？'),
 answer:B('Resize updates the surface configuration and next frame’s projection. Native rendering skips a zero-sized window. Width and height passed to configure or prepare must be nonzero. CSS size alone does not resize GPU attachments.','Resize 更新 surface 配置以及下一帧的投影。桌面渲染会跳过零尺寸窗口。传给 configure 或 prepare 的宽高必须非零，只修改 CSS 大小不会调整 GPU 附件。'),refs:['wgpu','winit'],math:'/learn/12-build-and-explain/'
},
{
 id:'03-your-first-triangle',phase:0,stage:1,title:B('Teach the GPU to draw a triangle','教 GPU 画出第一个三角形'),
 goal:B('Connect shader stages, draw calls and interpolation to visible pixels.','把 shader 阶段、draw call、插值与实际像素连接起来。'),
 intro:B('Three corners are enough to test most of the drawing path. If a triangle fails, loading a hundred thousand Gaussians will only hide the cause.','三个顶点足以检查绘图链路的主要部分。三角形还没画对，就加载十万个 Gaussian，只会更难定位原因。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Give each invocation a vertex number','1. 给每次执行一个顶点编号'),[P('draw(0..3, 0..1) requests three vertices for one instance. The GPU runs vs_main with vertex_index 0, 1 and 2. For this first milestone, positions and colors live in tiny WGSL arrays, so no vertex buffer is needed. A range’s end is excluded: 0..3 means exactly three vertices.','draw(0..3, 0..1) 为一个实例请求三个顶点。GPU 用 vertex_index 0、1、2 执行 vs_main。第一阶段把位置和颜色直接放在很小的 WGSL 数组中，不需要顶点 buffer。Rust 区间不包含右端点，所以 0..3 正好是三个顶点。')]),
 S(B('2. Separate position from interpolated data','2. 分开位置和需要插值的数据'),[P('The vertex shader returns builtin(position), a four-number clip-space position. With w = 1, dividing xyz by w leaves the numbers unchanged. The x and y range −1 to +1 spans the viewport; WebGPU depth after division is 0 to 1. A location field is a varying: the rasterizer interpolates it across covered samples.','顶点 shader 输出 builtin(position)，即四个数构成的裁剪空间位置。w = 1 时，xyz 除以 w 后数值不变。x、y 的 −1 到 +1 覆盖视口；WebGPU 除法后的深度范围是 0 到 1。location 字段是 varying，光栅器会在覆盖的采样点之间对它插值。'),P('Our corner colors are red, green and blue. The fragment shader receives mixtures inside the triangle. No CPU loop visits each pixel. Fixed-function triangle rasterization determines coverage, then our fragment program supplies the color. Later, a Gaussian will use that same coverage machinery with a different color/alpha function.','三个角的颜色分别是红、绿、蓝，片元 shader 在三角形内部收到混合颜色。CPU 没有逐像素循环：固定功能三角形光栅化负责覆盖，片元程序给出颜色。后面的 Gaussian 也会复用这套覆盖机制，只是换成另一种颜色与透明度函数。')]),
 S(B('3. A pipeline connects the pieces','3. 用 pipeline 把它们连接起来'),[P('Create a shader module from WGSL, then a render pipeline using vs_main and fs_main. The output color format must match the surface. TriangleList is the default topology. Depth is disabled for these first experiments; depth testing is not a prerequisite for producing a triangle.','从 WGSL 创建 shader module，然后用 vs_main 和 fs_main 创建 render pipeline。输出颜色格式必须与 surface 一致。默认拓扑是 TriangleList。前几个实验关闭深度测试；画出一个三角形不要求先实现深度缓冲。'),P('The workshop keeps one pipeline across the toy stages and branches on a small stage uniform. That is a teaching convenience, not a recommendation to put every engine feature into one giant shader. Once behavior is understood, separate variants when their resource layouts or performance justify it.','实验用同一个 pipeline 支持多个小阶段，通过 stage uniform 分支选择，这是教学上的便利，不意味着引擎所有功能都应堆进一个巨大 shader。理解行为后，若资源布局或性能需要，可拆分不同变体。')]),
 S(B('4. Debug from the outside inward','4. 从外到内排查黑屏'),[P('First confirm clear/present works. Then verify the pipeline is bound, draw count is three, w is positive and clip positions are in range. Finally inspect fragment output. Change the shader to return solid magenta to isolate varying errors from coverage errors. Rebuild WASM after Rust or WGSL edits; a browser refresh alone cannot compile them.','先确认清屏和显示正常，再检查 pipeline 是否绑定、顶点数是否为 3、w 是否为正、裁剪位置是否在范围内，最后看片元输出。让 shader 固定返回洋红色，便能把 varying 错误与覆盖错误分开。修改 Rust 或 WGSL 后要重新构建 WASM，只刷新浏览器不会编译它们。')])],
 commands:'cargo run --locked --example workshop -- 1\n# After a Rust/WGSL edit, rebuild the browser binary:\nnpm run build:wasm',
 expected:B('A triangle with three colored corners and smooth color interpolation, surrounded by the clear color.','一个三个角颜色不同、内部平滑插值的三角形，周围是清屏色。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop.wgsl','triangle',B('The first shader returns positions and colors directly.','第一个 shader 直接返回位置和颜色。')),C('src/workshop.rs','pipeline',B('Shader code becomes a pipeline compatible with the render target.','Shader 代码组成兼容渲染目标的 pipeline。'))],
 task:B('Change the draw count from three to two, predict the result, then restore it. Why does a TriangleList not produce a line?','把顶点数从 3 改成 2，预测结果，再还原。为什么 TriangleList 不会因此画出一条线？'),
 answer:B('Two vertices do not form a complete triangle, so no triangle is rasterized. The topology decides how vertices form primitives; a line requires a line topology, not merely fewer vertices.','两个顶点无法组成完整三角形，因此不会光栅化三角形。拓扑决定顶点如何组成图元，画线需要线拓扑，不只是减少顶点数。'),refs:['gpu','wgpu'],math:'/learn/03-camera-to-ellipse/'
},
{
 id:'04-numbers-into-gpu-memory',phase:1,stage:2,title:B('Move numbers from Rust into GPU memory','把 Rust 中的数字送进 GPU 内存'),
 goal:B('Build the Rust/WGSL data contract and draw one quad per instance.','建立 Rust/WGSL 数据约定，让每个实例绘制一个四边形。'),
 intro:B('A shader cannot follow a Rust pointer to a Vec. We must explicitly copy bytes into GPU memory and tell both sides what those bytes mean. This is one of the most useful debugging skills in graphics.','Shader 不能顺着 Rust 指针去读取 Vec。我们需要主动把字节复制到 GPU 内存，并约定每段字节的含义。这是图形开发最有用的排错能力之一。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Start with a byte ruler','1. 先拿出“字节尺”'),[P('One f32 occupies four bytes. A vec4<f32> occupies sixteen. Our Instance has three vec4 blocks: center plus opacity, scale plus padding, RGB plus padding. Its stride is 48 bytes. The uniform contains a mat4 at bytes 0–63 and one vec4 at bytes 64–79, making 80 bytes. Rust repr(C), Pod and Zeroable make this explicit and checkable.','一个 f32 占 4 字节，一个 vec4<f32> 占 16 字节。Instance 有三个 vec4 块：中心与不透明度、尺度与填充、RGB 与填充，步长共 48 字节。Uniform 的矩阵占 0–63 字节，vec4 占 64–79 字节，总共 80 字节。Rust 的 repr(C)、Pod、Zeroable 让这个结构明确且可检查。'),P('Do not assume a Rust [f32; 3] and a WGSL vec3 will automatically produce the same struct offsets. WGSL alignment rules matter. Padding deliberately with vec4 blocks makes this first contract easy to inspect. The tests check actual Rust sizes, while GPU validation and pixel tests check the complete path.','不要假定 Rust [f32; 3] 与 WGSL vec3 在结构体中的偏移天然一致，必须考虑 WGSL 对齐规则。先用 vec4 显式填充，让数据约定容易检查。测试检查真实 Rust 大小，GPU 验证和像素测试再检查整条链路。')]),
 S(B('2. Describe access before sending data','2. 先描述访问方式，再发送数据'),[P('UNIFORM is for per-frame camera and stage values. STORAGE holds an array of instances. COPY_DST permits queue.write_buffer uploads. A bind group layout describes binding numbers and access types; a bind group connects those slots to actual buffers. Binding 0 and 1 must match the WGSL declarations.','UNIFORM 存每帧的相机与阶段信息，STORAGE 存实例数组，COPY_DST 允许 queue.write_buffer 上传。Bind group layout 描述绑定编号与访问类型，bind group 再把插槽连接到真实 buffer。绑定 0、1 必须与 WGSL 声明一致。')]),
 S(B('3. Build a rectangle with two triangles','3. 用两个三角形拼矩形'),[P('A quad is six vertex invocations: two triangles sharing two corner positions. vertex_index chooses a corner, instance_index chooses a Gaussian record. Stage 2 writes the selected record’s RGB directly and forces alpha to one, so the rectangle has a hard boundary. We have not applied the Gaussian function yet.','四边形需要六次顶点执行：两个三角形共享其中两个角的位置。vertex_index 选择角，instance_index 选择 Gaussian 记录。阶段 2 直接写记录中的 RGB 并把 alpha 设为 1，所以矩形边缘是硬的。此时还没有使用高斯函数。')]),
 S(B('4. Upload what actually changes','4. 上传真正变化的数据'),[P('For two toy records, copying 96 bytes per frame is easy to inspect. For a real model, repeatedly uploading every record wastes bandwidth. The production-facing StgPass keeps source records resident and uploads only a uniform and sorted source indices. Learn the small direct version first, then make that one change in ownership.','对于两个教学记录，每帧复制 96 字节便于理解；对于真实模型，反复上传所有记录会浪费带宽。面向真实模型的 StgPass 让原始记录常驻 GPU，只更新 uniform 和排序后的源索引。先学直接的小版本，再改变数据所有权。')])],
 commands:'cargo run --locked --example workshop -- 2\ncargo test workshop::tests::host_shader_contract_and_invalid_input',
 expected:B('One solid orange rectangle. No falloff yet. Its color comes from the Rust record through a storage buffer.','一个实心橙色矩形，还没有渐变衰减；颜色从 Rust 记录经 storage buffer 传入。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop.rs','layout',B('Count the bytes on the CPU side.','在 CPU 端数清字节。')),C('src/workshop.wgsl','layout',B('Match the shader offsets and binding slots.','对照 shader 偏移与绑定插槽。')),C('src/workshop.rs','buffers',B('Create memory, describe its access, then bind it.','创建内存、描述访问、再进行绑定。'))],
 task:B('Set color_pad to [0, 1, 0, 0]. Explain why changing the fourth number alone has no visible effect in this milestone.','把 color_pad 改成 [0, 1, 0, 0]。解释为什么只改第四个数字，这一阶段画面不变。'),
 answer:B('The quad becomes green. The shader reads only color_pad.xyz; the fourth number is padding. Opacity comes from center_alpha.w and stage 2 overrides it with one. A field name alone does not make a value affect rendering.','矩形会变绿。Shader 只读取 color_pad.xyz，第四个数是填充。不透明度来自 center_alpha.w，且阶段 2 会把它替换成 1。字段有名字，不代表它一定参与渲染。'),refs:['gpu'],math:'/learn/11-export-the-contract/'
},
{
 id:'05-soft-splats-and-alpha',phase:1,stage:4,title:B('Turn a rectangle into a soft splat','把矩形变成柔软的 Gaussian'),
 goal:B('Implement Gaussian falloff, premultiplied alpha and order-dependent composition.','实现高斯衰减、预乘透明度以及依赖顺序的合成。'),
 intro:B('The rectangle only decides where fragments may run. The Gaussian function decides how much each fragment contributes. Separating those two ideas explains both the soft shape and why large splats can be expensive.','矩形只决定哪些区域可能运行片元 shader，高斯函数决定每个片元贡献多少。分清这两件事，就能解释柔软形状，也能理解大 splat 为什么耗性能。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Put a local coordinate on the rectangle','1. 给矩形放一套局部坐标'),[P('The vertex shader assigns local coordinates from −3 to +3 along both axes. The rasterizer interpolates them. At the center, local = (0, 0); one standard deviation to the right is (1, 0). These coordinates describe distance inside this Gaussian, not meters in the scene.','顶点 shader 给两个方向赋予 −3 到 +3 的局部坐标，光栅器负责插值。中心是 (0, 0)，往右一个标准差是 (1, 0)。它描述在当前 Gaussian 内的距离，不是场景中的米。')]),
 S(B('2. Calculate one fragment by hand','2. 手算一个片元'),[P('Square the two coordinates, add them, multiply by −1/2 and exponentiate. At (0,0) the weight is 1. At (1,0) it is about 0.6065. With base opacity 0.8, alpha is about 0.4852 there. Stage 3 now reveals a soft orange splat inside the same two triangles. We discard alpha below 1/255 and cap it at 0.99, matching the teaching baseline.','把两个坐标分别平方，相加，乘 −1/2，再求指数。(0,0) 的权重是 1；(1,0) 约为 0.6065。若基础不透明度为 0.8，这里的 alpha 约为 0.4852。阶段 3 会在同样两个三角形中显出柔软的橙色 splat。实验与教学基线一样，丢弃小于 1/255 的 alpha，并限制最高为 0.99。')],String.raw`g(u,v)=e^{-\frac12(u^2+v^2)},\qquad\alpha=o\,g,\qquad C_{\mathrm{shader}}=\alpha\,c`),
 S(B('3. Pre-multiply exactly once','3. 颜色只预乘一次'),[P('The shader returns (alpha × RGB, alpha), so the pipeline uses PREMULTIPLIED_ALPHA_BLENDING. New foreground color replaces a fraction of the old background: C = alpha × foreground + (1 − alpha) × background. Returning straight RGB into that blend rule makes transparent edges too bright; multiplying again in the blend makes them too dark.','Shader 返回 (alpha × RGB, alpha)，所以 pipeline 使用 PREMULTIPLIED_ALPHA_BLENDING。新前景替换旧背景的一部分：C = alpha × 前景 + (1 − alpha) × 背景。若在这种规则下返回未预乘 RGB，透明边缘会过亮；若在混合时再乘一次，则会过暗。')]),
 S(B('4. Reverse two splats and predict the color','4. 反转两个 splat，预测颜色'),[P('Stage 4 draws a far blue-tinted splat (0, 0.25, 1) then a near red splat (1, 0, 0), each with center opacity 0.5. Over black, their ideal center RGB is (0.5, 0.0625, 0.25). Reverse the order and it becomes (0.25, 0.125, 0.5). Pixel centers rarely coincide exactly with the mathematical center, so measured pixels differ slightly.','阶段 4 先画远处的蓝色 splat (0, 0.25, 1)，再画近处的红色 splat (1, 0, 0)，中心透明度都是 0.5。黑底上理想中心 RGB 为 (0.5, 0.0625, 0.25)，反转顺序则变为 (0.25, 0.125, 0.5)。像素中心通常不会刚好与数学中心重合，所以实测会略有差别。'),P('This path draws back to front and lets fixed-function blending compose colors. The common compute rasterizer instead walks sorted splats front to back while accumulating transmittance. Both can express the same over operation, but their loop direction and update equations must agree.','此路径从后往前绘制，由固定功能混合完成合成。常见 compute 光栅器则从前往后遍历排序后的 splat，同时累计透射率。两者可以表达相同的 over 运算，但循环方向必须与更新公式匹配。')])],
 commands:'cargo run --locked --example workshop -- 3\n# Press 4, or open stage 4 online and toggle Reverse draw order.\ncargo run --locked --example workshop_pixels',
 expected:B('Stage 3: one soft orange splat. Stage 4: overlapping red and blue; reversing order changes the overlap color.','阶段 3：一个柔软橙色 splat。阶段 4：红蓝重叠，反转顺序会改变重叠颜色。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop.wgsl','fragment',B('These five operations turn coverage into Gaussian opacity and color.','这几个操作将覆盖区域变成高斯透明度和颜色。'))],
 task:B('Before toggling order, write down which channel will get stronger. Then set both opacities near zero in Rust and predict the background.','切换顺序前，写下哪个颜色通道会变强。再在 Rust 里把两个不透明度都调到接近零，预测背景。'),
 answer:B('Putting blue last raises blue and lowers red. Near-zero opacity approaches the background. Turning on depth writes for these transparent quads would discard contributions rather than correctly solve transparency.','最后画蓝色会让蓝色增强、红色减弱。不透明度接近零时，结果趋近背景。给透明四边形打开深度写入会丢掉贡献，并不能正确解决透明合成。'),refs:['gs','gpu'],math:'/learn/04-many-splats-one-pixel/'
},
{
 id:'06-camera-and-ellipses',phase:1,stage:5,title:B('Give the splat a camera and a 3D shape','为 splat 加上相机与三维形状'),
 goal:B('Connect world/view/clip coordinates, the projection derivative and a screen-space ellipse.','打通世界、观察、裁剪坐标，连接投影导数与屏幕椭圆。'),
 intro:B('A screen-space blob always faces us in the same shape. A 3D Gaussian behaves differently: rotate the camera and its projected footprint changes. We will derive that change from three short axes.','屏幕上的光斑总以相同形状面对我们，3D Gaussian 则不同：旋转相机，投影形状会变化。我们用三根短轴推导这个变化。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Move the world into the camera’s coordinate system','1. 把世界搬进相机坐标系'),[P('The view matrix answers “where is this point relative to the camera?” The projection matrix makes distant objects smaller. The code applies projection × view × point, using column-major matrices. A point carries w = 1 so translation affects it; an axis direction carries w = 0 so translation does not affect it.','View 矩阵回答“这个点相对相机在哪”，Projection 矩阵让远处物体变小。代码按 projection × view × point 计算，矩阵为列主序。点的 w = 1，会受平移影响；轴方向的 w = 0，不受平移影响。'),P('The toy camera looks along its local −Z with +Y up. The research capture has a different world orientation, so the stage 7 camera uses −Y up. This is a dataset convention, not a different projection equation. Keep the conversion at the data boundary.','教学相机朝自己的 −Z 方向看，+Y 向上。研究数据的世界方向不同，因此阶段 7 使用 −Y 向上。这是数据集坐标约定，不是换了投影公式。坐标转换应在数据边界明确处理。')]),
 S(B('2. Divide only after reaching clip space','2. 到裁剪空间后再做除法'),[P('The GPU divides clip xyz by clip w to obtain NDC. For a small world axis a, compute delta = VP × (a, 0). The quotient rule tells us how clip.xy / clip.w changes along that axis. Multiply by half the viewport dimensions to convert that small NDC movement to pixels.','GPU 将 clip xyz 除以 clip w 得到 NDC。对一根短世界轴 a，先计算 delta = VP × (a, 0)。商的求导法则告诉我们 clip.xy / clip.w 沿这根轴如何变化，再乘视口尺寸的一半，把微小 NDC 变化换成像素。'),P('You can read the derivative as “how many pixels would this tiny movement move the point?” This is a first-order approximation around the Gaussian center. It is accurate for small footprints away from the camera plane, not an exact projection of an arbitrarily large volume.','把导数读成一句话：“这个微小移动会让点在屏幕上走多少像素？”它是 Gaussian 中心附近的一阶近似，适合远离相机平面的小 footprint，不是任意大体积的精确投影。')],String.raw`d=\frac{\Delta_{xy}c_w-c_{xy}\Delta_w}{c_w^2}\odot\left(\frac W2,\frac H2\right)`),
 S(B('3. Add three projected axes into a covariance','3. 将三根投影轴合成协方差'),[P('Project each scaled world axis into 2D, giving d₀, d₁, d₂. For each axis take its outer product, then add the three matrices. This yields [[a,b],[b,c]]. The diagonal describes spread in x and y; b describes their correlation. Adding 0.3 to the diagonal is the baseline’s pixel-space footprint regularization.','将三根带尺度的世界轴投影成二维向量 d₀、d₁、d₂。每根轴与自身做外积，再将三个矩阵相加，得到 [[a,b],[b,c]]。对角元素描述 x、y 的分散程度，b 描述两者关联。对角线上加 0.3，是基线在像素空间的 footprint 正则化。')],String.raw`\Sigma_{2D}=\sum_{i=0}^{2}d_i d_i^T+0.3I,\quad\lambda_{\pm}=\frac{a+c\pm\sqrt{(a-c)^2+4b^2}}2`),
 S(B('4. Turn covariance into two visible axes','4. 把协方差变成两根可见轴'),[P('Eigenvectors give the ellipse directions; square roots of eigenvalues give one-standard-deviation lengths. Extend three standard deviations along each direction to place the quad’s corners. Convert the pixel offset back to NDC and multiply by center.w before adding to clip.xy. Omitting that last multiplication makes size change incorrectly with depth.','特征向量给出椭圆方向，特征值的平方根给出一个标准差的长度。沿两个方向各延伸三个标准差以放置 quad 顶点。像素偏移换回 NDC 后，还要乘 center.w 才能加到 clip.xy。漏掉这一步，尺寸就会随深度错误变化。'),P('The toy uses axis-aligned 3D scales so the camera effect is isolated. The real shader first builds rotated axes from a quaternion. The toy camera range keeps both centers safely in front of the camera; a general viewer additionally needs robust near-plane handling and conservative bounds.','教学场景使用沿世界轴的三维尺度，方便单独观察相机作用。真实 shader 会先用四元数构建旋转后的轴。教学相机范围保证两个中心都在相机前方；通用 viewer 还需要稳健的近裁剪面处理与保守包围范围。')])],
 commands:'cargo run --locked --example workshop -- 5\n# Arrow keys orbit; Home resets. The browser also supports drag and sliders.',
 expected:B('Two anisotropic splats. Orbiting changes their shape, overlap and ordering; changing distance changes their apparent size.','两个各向异性的 splat。绕转相机会改变形状、重叠与排序；调整距离会改变屏幕大小。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop.rs','camera',B('This maps input angles to view and projection matrices.','将输入角度映射成观察与投影矩阵。')),C('src/workshop.wgsl','jacobian',B('This is the quotient rule written directly in WGSL.','这是直接写成 WGSL 的商求导法则。')),C('src/workshop.wgsl','covariance',B('Projected axes become eigenvectors, then quad corners.','投影轴成为特征向量，再成为 quad 顶点。'))],
 task:B('Double all three world scales while keeping the camera fixed. Will the eigenvalues double or quadruple? What about ellipse radii before regularization matters?','固定相机，将三个世界尺度全部翻倍。特征值会翻倍还是变成四倍？忽略正则项影响时，椭圆半径怎样变化？'),
 answer:B('Projected axes double, their outer products quadruple, and square-root radii double. The additive 0.3 term makes this only approximate for very small footprints.','投影轴翻倍，外积变为四倍，开平方后的半径翻倍。对很小的 footprint，由于额外的 0.3 项，这个关系只是近似。'),refs:['gs','colmap'],math:'/learn/03-camera-to-ellipse/'
},
{
 id:'07-load-a-real-model',phase:2,stage:7,title:B('Load a real model without guessing its meaning','明确数据含义，再加载真实模型'),
 goal:B('Decode a specific model contract, upload persistent records, and render the pretrained fixture.','解码具体模型约定，上传常驻记录，渲染预训练数据。'),
 intro:B('PLY tells you how fields are stored. It does not tell you whether “scale” means a physical length or its logarithm, or whether “color” means RGB or SH coefficients. A loader that guesses may produce a plausible but wrong picture.','PLY 告诉你字段怎么存，却不自动告诉你 scale 是真实长度还是长度的对数，也不告诉你 color 是 RGB 还是 SH 系数。靠猜的加载器可能生成看似合理却错误的图像。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Write the contract before the decoder','1. 先写约定，再写解码器'),[P('This fixture is STG-Lite: 32 little-endian float32 fields per record, 128 bytes. It stores position, temporal center/log-scale, unused normal slots, nine motion coefficients, three direct RGB features, opacity logit, three log-scales, quaternion wxyz and quaternion velocity. The field order is strict. This is not a universal 4DGS layout.','本数据是 STG-Lite：每条记录 32 个小端 float32 字段，共 128 字节，包含位置、时间中心与时间对数尺度、未使用法线槽、九个运动系数、三个直接 RGB 特征、不透明度 logit、三个对数尺度、wxyz 四元数及其速度。字段顺序严格固定，这不是通用 4DGS 布局。'),P('In this model the f_dc fields hold direct RGB features used by the lightweight renderer. Do not apply the static 3DGS SH-DC conversion just because the property names look familiar. The SH laboratory teaches a different appearance model; it does not add missing SH coefficients to this file.','此模型的 f_dc 字段保存轻量渲染器使用的直接 RGB 特征。不要只因名字熟悉，就套用静态 3DGS 的 SH-DC 转换。SH 实验讲的是另一种外观模型，不会给这个文件补出不存在的 SH 系数。')]),
 S(B('2. Decode, validate, then activate','2. 解码、验证，再激活'),[P('The strict parser checks header types/order, count limits, payload size, finite values and activation overflow. Only then upload the record array. Runtime scales use exp(log_scale); opacity uses sigmoid(logit). Passing log-scale directly into a covariance would square the wrong number.','严格解析器会检查头部类型与顺序、数量上限、payload 大小、有限数值以及激活溢出，然后才上传记录数组。运行时尺度使用 exp(log_scale)，不透明度使用 sigmoid(logit)。若直接把 log-scale 塞进协方差，就会对错误的量平方。')],String.raw`s=e^{s_{\log}},\qquad o=\frac1{1+e^{-\beta}},\qquad \rho=e^{\rho_{\log}}`),
 S(B('3. Keep the source on the GPU','3. 让原始记录常驻 GPU'),[P('StgPass::new uploads the source payload once. Each frame, prepare evaluates centers and opacity on the CPU, culls and sorts them, then uploads the ordered u32 indices. The shader uses each source index to read the original record and evaluates time-dependent geometry again. CPU and GPU evaluation must stay consistent or sorting will describe a different scene.','StgPass::new 只上传一次原始 payload。每帧 prepare 在 CPU 上求中心与透明度、剔除并排序，然后上传排序后的 u32 索引。Shader 用源索引读取原始记录，再计算随时间变化的几何。CPU 与 GPU 求值必须一致，否则排序对应的是另一个场景。'),P('At 108,317 records, source storage is 13,864,576 bytes, about 13.22 MiB. One full u32 index order is 433,268 bytes, about 0.41 MiB. Compressed download size is a separate number; neither value measures the complete process or GPU memory footprint.','108,317 条记录的源数据占 13,864,576 字节，约 13.22 MiB；一份完整 u32 索引序列占 433,268 字节，约 0.41 MiB。压缩下载大小又是另一个数字，这两个数都不代表进程或 GPU 的总内存占用。')]),
 S(B('4. Compare under a known camera','4. 在已知相机下对比'),[P('Stage 7 gives an orbitable overview. Use the main viewer’s calibrated reference comparison when judging agreement with the research image. A different pose, field of view, crop or timestamp can dominate apparent error. The included asset is an official pretrained research fixture, not evidence that this project trained that scene.','阶段 7 提供可绕转的全景观察。判断与研究图像是否一致时，应使用主 viewer 的标定相机参考对比。姿态、视野、裁剪或时间不同，都可能主导视觉误差。附带的是官方预训练研究数据，不代表本项目训练了该场景。'),P('The demo is for non-commercial research/evaluation; check the upstream model and dataset terms before reusing assets. A model loader should carry provenance and representation metadata alongside the byte layout.','此演示用于非商业研究与评估，复用资产前应查看上游模型和数据集条款。加载器除字节布局外，还应保存来源与表示方法元数据。')])],
 commands:'cargo run --locked --example workshop -- 7\n# Online: choose stage 7, then Load research model.\ncargo run --locked --example native_smoke',
 expected:B('The Sear steak research scene, rendered by the existing StgPass inside the new shared host. Model download requires an explicit button online.','在新共享宿主内，由已有 StgPass 渲染 Sear steak 研究场景；在线版点击按钮后才下载模型。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop.rs','prepare',B('Stage 7 delegates to the real pass without changing the host.','阶段 7 转交真实 pass，宿主无需改变。'))],
 task:B('Why would a generic XYZRGB PLY loader be insufficient even if it can read every byte in this file?','即使普通 XYZRGB PLY 加载器能读完所有字节，为什么仍然不够？'),
 answer:B('It would miss activation, time, shape, quaternion order and the renderer’s appearance convention. Storage decoding and representation decoding are separate responsibilities.','它会遗漏激活、时间、形状、四元数顺序与外观约定。解码存储格式和解码表示含义，是两项不同职责。'),refs:['stg'],math:'/learn/11-export-the-contract/'
},
{
 id:'08-make-time-explicit',phase:2,stage:6,title:B('Make time an explicit rendering input','让时间成为输入'),
 goal:B('Evaluate motion and temporal opacity, then keep camera, sort and playback synchronized.','计算运动与时间透明度，让相机、排序及播放保持同步。'),
 intro:B('Pressing play should change Gaussian parameters before projection. That is different from putting prerecorded frames onto a rectangle. You can freeze time and still move the camera.','播放应在投影之前改变 Gaussian 参数，这与把录好的视频贴到矩形上不同。你可以冻结时间，同时继续移动相机。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Separate seconds from model time','1. 区分秒与模型时间'),[P('The UI owns elapsed seconds. The renderer receives normalized time t in [0,1]. A ten-second loop maps seconds/10 into that interval. The file does not magically define the playback duration. Capture time range, loop behavior and synchronization belong in explicit metadata or host policy.','界面管理经过的秒数，渲染器接收 [0,1] 范围内的归一化时间 t。十秒循环把秒数除以 10 映射进去。文件不会自动定义播放时长，采集时间范围、循环行为、同步方式应来自明确元数据或宿主策略。')],String.raw`t=\operatorname{fract}(s/T),\qquad\Delta t=t-\tau`),
 S(B('2. Move the center before projecting it','2. 先移动中心，再做投影'),[P('In stage 6, the red Gaussian uses x += 2.5Δt and y += 1.5Δt², while blue moves in the opposite x direction. At t = 0.5, Δt = 0 and both return to their base centers. At t = 0.9, the red displacement is (1.0, 0.24, 0). The real STG model extends this to a cubic vector polynomial and time-dependent quaternion.','阶段 6 中，红色 Gaussian 使用 x += 2.5Δt、y += 1.5Δt²，蓝色沿相反 x 方向移动。t = 0.5 时 Δt = 0，都回到基础中心。t = 0.9 时，红色位移为 (1.0, 0.24, 0)。真实 STG 模型把它扩展为三次向量多项式及随时间变化的四元数。')],String.raw`\mu(t)=\mu_0+m_1\Delta t+m_2\Delta t^2+m_3\Delta t^3`),
 S(B('3. Fade a Gaussian through its lifetime','3. 让 Gaussian 随生命周期淡入淡出'),[P('Multiply base opacity by exp(−(Δt/ρ)²). At Δt = 0, the factor is 1; at Δt = ρ, it is e⁻¹ ≈ 0.3679. This STG convention does not put 1/2 in the exponent. A spatial Gaussian and this temporal envelope have similar shapes but different parameter conventions.','基础不透明度乘 exp(−(Δt/ρ)²)。Δt = 0 时因子为 1，Δt = ρ 时为 e⁻¹ ≈ 0.3679。这个 STG 约定在指数里没有 1/2。空间 Gaussian 与时间包络形状相似，但参数约定不同。')],String.raw`o(t)=\operatorname{sigmoid}(\beta)\exp\!\left[-\left(\frac{t-\tau}{\rho}\right)^2\right]`),
 S(B('4. A frame must use one time consistently','4. 一帧里必须使用同一个时间'),[P('Evaluate the current centers, compute camera-space depths, sort, upload, draw and submit using the same t. Sorting base centers and drawing moved centers produces incorrect overlap. Pausing freezes t, not the camera controls. Returning from a background browser tab resets the wall-clock delta so the animation does not leap unexpectedly.','用同一个 t 求当前中心、计算相机深度、排序、上传、绘制并提交。按基础中心排序、却绘制移动后的中心，会导致重叠错误。暂停冻结的是 t，不是相机操作。从浏览器后台返回时重置时钟差，避免意外跳跃。'),P('A renderer can evaluate intermediate times without proving those times are accurate reconstructions. A viewer’s smooth playback and a trained model’s temporal quality are different claims. Check held-out times and views when evaluating the model.','能计算中间时间，并不证明这些时间的重建准确。Viewer 播放流畅，与模型时间质量好，是不同的结论。评价模型时需检查未用于训练的时间及视角。')])],
 commands:'cargo run --locked --example workshop -- 6\n# Space pauses; arrow keys still orbit. Online, scrub t before pressing Play.',
 expected:B('Two splats move and one fades. Pause at t = 0.9 and orbit: time stays fixed while the viewpoint changes.','两个 splat 移动，其中一个还会淡出。暂停在 t = 0.9 再绕转，时间不变而视点改变。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop.rs','motion',B('Motion is evaluated before depth sorting.','运动求值发生在深度排序之前。')),C('public/build/lab.mjs','browser-frame',B('The host maps real time to the renderer’s normalized input.','宿主把真实时间映射成渲染器的归一化输入。'))],
 task:B('Freeze at t = 0.9. Predict the red opacity multiplier when ρ = 0.45, then compute it.','固定 t = 0.9，ρ = 0.45 时，先预测红色不透明度乘数，再计算。'),
 answer:B('Δt = 0.4. exp(−(0.4/0.45)²) ≈ 0.4538, so the base 0.5 opacity becomes about 0.2269. The motion and fade use the same temporal offset.','Δt = 0.4，exp(−(0.4/0.45)²) ≈ 0.4538，所以基础 0.5 不透明度变为约 0.2269。运动和淡出使用同一个时间偏移。'),refs:['stg'],math:'/learn/06-add-time/'
},
{
 id:'09-training-to-runtime',phase:2,stage:7,title:B('Trace one learned number all the way to a pixel','追踪一个学到的参数，直到最终像素'),
 goal:B('Connect capture, optimization, export and runtime without confusing a viewer with a trainer.','连接采集、优化、导出与运行时，分清 viewer 和训练器的职责。'),
 intro:B('The viewer is the last half of an inverse-rendering loop. To build it correctly, follow one number—such as opacity logit—from an optimizer update into a file, through activation, and finally into blending.','Viewer 位于逆渲染闭环的后半段。要正确构建它，可以追踪一个数字，例如不透明度 logit：从优化器更新，到文件、激活，再到混合。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Observations define the problem','1. 观测定义了训练问题'),[P('Capture supplies images, camera intrinsics, camera poses and timestamps. Split training observations from held-out evaluation views/times. Check units and camera conventions before optimizing: wrong poses can look like a model that refuses to learn. Resizing an image also requires scaling focal lengths and principal point coordinates.','采集提供图像、相机内参、相机姿态与时间戳。将训练观测与留出的评估视角、时间分开。优化前检查单位及相机约定；错误姿态可能看起来像模型学不动。缩放图像时，也要缩放焦距和主点坐标。')]),
 S(B('2. Differentiate a predicted image','2. 对预测图像求导'),[P('Initialize model parameters. Render the sampled camera/time, compare predicted pixels with target pixels, differentiate the chosen loss and update parameters. Repeat with a defined sampling schedule. A differentiable training rasterizer needs gradients through projection, appearance and composition; this real-time Rust viewer implements forward rendering only.','初始化模型参数，渲染采样的相机与时间，比较预测像素和目标像素，对选定损失求导并更新参数，按明确的采样方式重复。可微训练光栅器需要投影、外观及合成的梯度；当前 Rust 实时 viewer 只实现前向渲染。'),P('The existing training laboratory actually updates three parameters of one Gaussian against fixed targets. Use it to watch loss, gradient and candidate update separately. It is a small synthetic learning problem, not full-scene training; the included Python toy trainer provides a separate PyTorch/Adam path.','已有训练实验会针对固定目标，真实更新一个 Gaussian 的三个参数。用它分别观察损失、梯度和候选更新。这是小型合成训练问题，不是完整场景训练；附带 Python 教学训练器另有 PyTorch/Adam 路径。')],String.raw`\widehat I=R(\theta,V,P,t),\qquad L=\|\widehat I-I^*\|^2,\qquad\theta'=\theta-\eta\nabla_\theta L`),
 S(B('3. Export the meaning of the learned values','3. 导出学到的数值及其含义'),[P('For one opacity logit β, the trainer updates β, the exporter writes β, the decoder reads β, and the shader computes sigmoid(β). Exporting sigmoid(β) into a field the viewer activates again changes the model. Apply the same audit to log-scales, quaternion order, motion time units and SH coefficient ordering.','对不透明度 logit β，训练器更新 β，导出器写 β，解码器读 β，shader 再求 sigmoid(β)。若导出时已经写成 sigmoid(β)，viewer 又激活一次，就改变了模型。对对数尺度、四元数顺序、运动时间单位和 SH 系数顺序，也要做同样核对。'),P('A training checkpoint may contain optimizer moments and neural network weights. A runtime package contains whatever its forward path needs. A deformation-based 4DGS model can require a deformation network; a native 4D Gaussian requires conditioning its joint spacetime distribution. Renaming either file to STG-Lite cannot make our polynomial decoder correct.','训练 checkpoint 可能带优化器动量及神经网络权重，运行包则包含前向路径需要的东西。基于形变的 4DGS 可能需要形变网络，原生 4D Gaussian 需要对联合时空分布做条件化。把文件改名为 STG-Lite，不能让多项式解码器正确处理它们。')]),
 S(B('4. Validate the bridge at three levels','4. 分三个层级验证连接'),[P('First compare decoded scalar values with the trainer’s export. Next compare a few projected centers and covariance matrices under a known camera. Finally compare the rendered image at that camera and timestamp. A beautiful orbiting preview can hide an activation or coordinate mismatch that a small numeric check immediately reveals.','先把解码后的标量与训练器导出值比较，再在已知相机下比较几个投影中心与协方差，最后比较该相机、该时间的图像。漂亮的绕转预览可能掩盖激活或坐标错误，而一个很小的数值检查就能发现。')])],
 commands:'npm run qa:math\n# Open /math/#training-lab for the step-by-step optimizer.\n# Open /learn/12-build-and-explain/ for the Python training/export capstone.',
 expected:B('You can point to the exact same raw opacity value in the training record, exported bytes and runtime decode, then explain its effect on a pixel.','能在训练记录、导出字节及运行时解码里指出同一个原始不透明度值，并解释它如何影响像素。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop.wgsl','fragment',B('The runtime end of the bridge: activated opacity becomes a pixel contribution.','连接的运行时末端：激活后的不透明度成为像素贡献。'))],
 task:B('A raw opacity logit is 0. What runtime opacity should the viewer use? What if an exporter writes 0.5 into that raw field?','原始不透明度 logit 为 0 时，运行时应使用多少不透明度？如果导出器把 0.5 写进原始字段会怎样？'),
 answer:B('sigmoid(0) = 0.5. If the raw field instead contains 0.5, the viewer computes sigmoid(0.5) ≈ 0.6225. This is a contract error, not a blending bug.','sigmoid(0) = 0.5；若原始字段写成 0.5，viewer 会算出 sigmoid(0.5) ≈ 0.6225。这是数据约定错误，不是混合错误。'),refs:['gs','stg','colmap'],math:'/math/#training-lab'
},
{
 id:'10-cross-platform-engine-pass',phase:3,stage:7,title:B('Integrate one pass into two hosts—and your engine','让同一个 pass 接入两个宿主和自研引擎'),
 goal:B('Define a reusable rendering boundary, then account for depth, color and device ownership in an existing engine.','定义可复用渲染边界，并在现有引擎里处理深度、色彩与设备所有权。'),
 intro:B('Cross-platform rendering starts with ownership and contracts. A shared source file is useful only if its host assumptions are explicit. The most reusable object in this project is the render pass, not the browser page.','跨平台渲染从职责与约定开始。共享代码的前提是把宿主假设说清楚。本项目最适合复用的是渲染 pass，而不是浏览器页面。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Keep the platform at the edges','1. 让平台差异留在边界'),[P('Browser code handles fetch, DOM events and requestAnimationFrame. Native code handles files, winit events and a monotonic clock. Both feed a Frame into WorkshopSurface, which calls the same WorkshopPass and WGSL. The model parser, time evaluation, ordering and data contract do not need a second implementation for these two hosts.','浏览器代码负责 fetch、DOM 事件和 requestAnimationFrame；桌面代码负责文件、winit 事件与单调时钟。两者都把 Frame 交给 WorkshopSurface，后者调用同一个 WorkshopPass 和 WGSL。对于这两个宿主，模型解析、时间求值、排序和数据约定不需要另写一份。'),P('wgpu translates the graphics work to supported backends. This sample selects D3D12 on Windows; macOS/Metal and Linux/Vulkan remain platform validation tasks until run there. A CUDA rasterizer would be a separate backend implementation sharing representation and algorithm contracts. CUDA is not a wgpu backend in this project.','wgpu 将图形工作映射到支持的后端。此示例在 Windows 选择 D3D12；macOS/Metal 和 Linux/Vulkan 仍需在对应平台实测。CUDA 光栅器需要单独实现后端，共享的是表示和算法约定。本项目的 wgpu 后端里没有 CUDA。')]),
 S(B('2. Let the engine own the device and frame','2. 让引擎拥有设备和帧'),[P('Inside an existing Rust/wgpu engine, use StgPass directly. Construct it with the engine’s Device and attachment format. Each frame, call prepare with the engine’s Queue, view matrix, projection matrix, viewport and normalized time. Open the engine’s render pass, call draw, then let the engine submit and present. Do not create another device inside this plugin.','在已有 Rust/wgpu 引擎里直接使用 StgPass。用引擎的 Device 与附件格式构造它。每帧用引擎的 Queue、观察矩阵、投影矩阵、视口和归一化时间调用 prepare；开启引擎自己的 render pass，调用 draw，最后由引擎提交和显示。不要在插件里额外创建一台 device。'),P('Submit one prepared frame before preparing another with the same mutable buffers. If a renderer prepares several cameras before submitting, each view needs its own buffer region or another explicit lifetime strategy. Otherwise the last write may supply data for earlier recorded work.','同一组可变 buffer 准备完一帧后，应先提交，再准备下一帧。如果渲染器在提交前准备多个相机，每个视图需要独立 buffer 区域或明确的生命周期策略，否则最后一次写入可能被之前记录的工作使用。')]),
 S(B('3. Agree on depth and color','3. 约定深度与色彩'),[P('Render opaque geometry first. Give the splat pipeline a compatible depth attachment, enable the appropriate depth comparison and keep splat depth writes disabled. Conventional Z often uses LessEqual; reverse Z often uses GreaterEqual, paired with the engine’s clear value and projection. Gaussian center-depth testing is an approximation, not exact volumetric intersection with meshes.','先绘制不透明几何。为 splat pipeline 配置兼容深度附件，使用正确深度比较，关闭 splat 深度写入。传统 Z 常用 LessEqual，反向 Z 常用 GreaterEqual，必须与引擎清屏值、投影配套。按 Gaussian 中心深度测试是一种近似，不等于与 mesh 精确求体积交。'),P('The render pass sample count and attachment format must match the pipeline. Current StgPass is single-sample. Decide how learned RGB maps into the engine’s linear/HDR working space before blending and tone mapping. Merely changing the attachment to sRGB or HDR does not establish that conversion.','Render pass 的采样数、附件格式必须与 pipeline 匹配，当前 StgPass 为单采样。应先确定学到的 RGB 如何映射进引擎线性/HDR 工作空间，再混合和 tone mapping。只把附件换成 sRGB 或 HDR，并不能自动建立正确转换。')]),
 S(B('4. Write a small host contract','4. 写一份小而明确的宿主约定'),[P('Record: right-handed view with forward −Z; column-major matrices; WebGPU clip depth 0..1; viewport in physical pixels; normalized model time; declared color convention; matching depth and sample count. These lines are more valuable than a vague “works cross-platform” badge.','写下：右手观察空间且朝 −Z；列主序矩阵；WebGPU 裁剪深度 0..1；视口为物理像素；模型时间已归一化；明确色彩约定；深度和采样数兼容。这几行比笼统的“支持跨平台”标签更有价值。')])],
 commands:'cargo run --locked --example workshop -- 7\ncargo run --locked --example workshop -- --smoke\ncargo check --locked --target wasm32-unknown-unknown',
 expected:B('One native host and one browser host render the same representation. The hidden-window smoke presents stages 0–7 and exits with status.','一个桌面宿主和一个浏览器宿主渲染同一表示。隐藏窗口 smoke 会显示提交阶段 0–7，随后退出并返回状态。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop_web.rs','web-create',B('The browser creates only its surface before calling the shared host.','浏览器创建自己的 surface 后便调用共享宿主。')),C('examples/workshop.rs','native-events',B('OS events are translated into the same input fields.','将系统事件转换成相同输入字段。'))],
 task:B('Your engine uses reverse Z and 4× MSAA. Can you insert the existing StgPass unchanged into that pass?','自研引擎使用反向 Z 与 4× MSAA，能直接把现有 StgPass 原封不动插进去吗？'),
 answer:B('No. Match depth comparison/projection/clear convention, and implement a matching multisample pipeline or use a deliberate single-sample composition stage. Also reconcile color space and attachment format.','不能。需要匹配深度比较、投影、清屏约定，并实现兼容的多重采样 pipeline，或有意使用独立的单采样合成阶段。同时核对色彩空间和附件格式。'),refs:['wgpu','winit'],math:'/learn/12-build-and-explain/'
},
{
 id:'11-profile-and-compute',phase:3,stage:7,title:B('Measure first, then design a compute rasterizer','先测量，再设计 compute 光栅器'),
 goal:B('Separate bottlenecks and connect today’s quad renderer to a future tile-based backend.','区分性能瓶颈，并把当前 quad 渲染器连接到未来的 tile 后端。'),
 intro:B('Two splats teach correctness. A hundred thousand reveal costs. The first optimization is to find out which cost you actually have: transfer, CPU sorting, vertex work, pixel overdraw or synchronization.','两个 splat 教你正确性，十万个 splat 暴露开销。优化的第一步是确认瓶颈：传输、CPU 排序、顶点计算、像素重复覆盖，还是同步。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Separate the clocks','1. 分开计时范围'),[P('Measure CPU preparation, CPU upload/submission, GPU pass duration and presentation separately. The time around queue.submit is not the time the GPU spent rendering. GPU timestamp queries are optional features; report their absence instead of filling the field with a CPU estimate. Our lab’s frame counter deliberately does not claim GPU milliseconds.','分别测 CPU 准备、CPU 上传与提交、GPU pass 耗时及显示。queue.submit 前后的时间不等于 GPU 渲染时间。GPU timestamp query 是可选能力，缺失时应明确标注，不要用 CPU 估计填进 GPU 指标。本实验的帧计数特意不冒充 GPU 毫秒数。')]),
 S(B('2. Work scales with coverage, not just point count','2. 工作量也取决于覆盖面积'),[P('Two scenes with equal Gaussian count can have different costs. Huge overlapping quads generate many fragment invocations. A tiny alpha can still require enough work to decide to discard it. Reduce resolution as an experiment: a large speedup suggests pixel cost, while unchanged time suggests another bottleneck. Keep camera and model time fixed during comparisons.','相同 Gaussian 数量的场景，耗时可能不同。巨大重叠 quad 会产生很多片元执行；很小的 alpha 也可能要先计算才能决定丢弃。可以降低分辨率做实验：明显加速提示像素成本，时间不变则提示其他瓶颈。比较时固定相机和模型时间。'),P('The current real pass sorts visible centers on the CPU and repeats geometric evaluation in the shader. Its center-margin culling and maximum footprint clamp are baseline heuristics, not conservative production solutions. Document these choices before interpreting image quality or speed differences.','当前真实 pass 在 CPU 对可见中心排序，并在 shader 重复几何求值。中心边距剔除与最大 footprint 限制都是基线启发式，不是生产级保守方案。解释画质或速度差异前，先记录这些选择。')]),
 S(B('3. Build the compute path as explicit stages','3. 把 compute 路径拆成明确阶段'),[P('A typical tile path projects splats, computes bounds, counts tile overlaps, prefix-sums counts into offsets, writes (tile, depth, splat) entries, sorts entries, finds per-tile ranges and composites pixels. Each stage has buffer capacities and overflow behavior. “Move it to compute” does not remove sorting, memory traffic or synchronization.','典型 tile 路径依次投影 splat、求边界、统计 tile 重叠数、前缀和生成偏移、写出 (tile, depth, splat) 条目、排序、找出每个 tile 的范围，最后合成像素。每步都需要 buffer 容量与溢出处理。“搬到 compute”并不会消除排序、内存流量或同步。'),P('Our existing mini_compute example is a deliberately smaller reference: a few CPU-ordered splats, one compute invocation per pixel, front-to-back transmittance, GPU readback and comparison with a CPU implementation. It does not implement tile binning or GPU sorting. Run that first before designing the larger pipeline.','已有 mini_compute 是特意缩小的参考：少量 CPU 排序 splat、每像素一个 compute 执行、从前往后累计透射率、GPU 回读并与 CPU 实现比较。它没有实现 tile 分桶或 GPU 排序。先跑通它，再设计更大的管线。')],String.raw`C\leftarrow C+T\alpha_i c_i,\qquad T\leftarrow T(1-\alpha_i),\qquad C_{\mathrm{final}}=C+T C_{\mathrm{bg}}`),
 S(B('4. Port algorithms, not platform accidents','4. 移植算法，不移植平台偶然行为'),[P('CUDA, Metal compute and WGSL compute differ in execution and memory capabilities. Keep a CPU reference, fixed input fixture, documented sort tie-breaks and pixel tolerances. A backend must preserve the model and composition contract, even if its workgroup sizes, scan or sort implementation differ.','CUDA、Metal compute 与 WGSL compute 在执行和内存能力上不同。保留 CPU 参考、固定输入、明确的排序同值规则与像素容差。即使工作组大小、扫描或排序实现不同，后端也必须保持模型与合成约定。')])],
 commands:'cargo run --locked --example mini_compute\n# Inspect artifacts/mini-compute/ and compare the correct/reversed-order PNGs.\ncargo run --locked --example native_smoke',
 expected:B('CPU/GPU pixel checks pass for the small compute rasterizer; reversing order changes the output. Readback latency is not a throughput benchmark.','小型 compute 光栅器通过 CPU/GPU 像素检查，反转顺序改变输出。回读延迟不是吞吐量基准。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop.rs','prepare',B('Inspect the current CPU-to-GPU boundary before moving work across it.','移动工作到 GPU 前，先看清现有 CPU/GPU 边界。'))],
 task:B('Why can a renderer get slower when its splat count stays constant but the camera moves closer?','Splat 数量不变，相机靠近后为什么可能变慢？'),
 answer:B('Projected footprints become larger and overlap more pixels, increasing fragment work and blending. Counting splats alone misses that cost. A tile implementation also creates more tile-overlap entries.','投影 footprint 变大、覆盖和重叠更多像素，增加片元及混合工作。只数 splat 看不到这种成本；tile 实现也会产生更多重叠条目。'),refs:['gs','gpu','wgpu'],math:'/docs/#this-renderer'
},
{
 id:'12-prove-and-ship',phase:3,stage:7,title:B('Prove it works, then ship and explain it','验证、交付，并把它讲明白'),
 goal:B('Produce repeatable evidence, a reviewable deployment and a concise engineering explanation.','形成可复现证据、可审阅部署以及清楚的工程讲解。'),
 intro:B('Hero is not “I can orbit a model.” It is “I know which numbers produce these pixels, can isolate a wrong result, and can state exactly which platforms I verified.” This final chapter turns the milestones into evidence.','Hero 不只是“我能绕着模型看”，而是“我知道哪些数生成这些像素，能定位错误，并准确说出验证过哪些平台”。最后一章把里程碑变成证据。'),
 sections:[
 S(B('1. Check contracts before screenshots','1. 截图前先检查约定'),[P('Run Rust unit tests for parsing, layout and ordering, then compile native examples and the WASM target. Run the site checks to catch broken links, missing bilingual content and formula rendering failures. These checks are complementary: successful compilation does not prove the shader produces the intended pixels.','先运行 Rust 单测，检查解析、布局及排序，再编译桌面示例与 WASM 目标。运行网站检查，捕捉断链、缺少双语内容和公式渲染失败。这些检查互补，编译成功不证明 shader 生成了正确像素。')]),
 S(B('2. Read back pixels for focused claims','2. 用像素回读验证具体结论'),[P('workshop_pixels renders stages to an offscreen GPU target. It checks a black clear, triangle coverage, solid quad, Gaussian falloff, order-dependent center color, camera change and time change. It saves PNGs and a JSON report. native_smoke separately tests the real model under known cameras/times; the hidden-window workshop smoke exercises acquire, submit and present.','workshop_pixels 把各阶段渲染到离屏 GPU 目标，检查黑色清屏、三角形覆盖、实心 quad、高斯衰减、中心颜色随排序变化、相机变化与时间变化，并保存 PNG 和 JSON 报告。native_smoke 单独验证真实模型的已知相机和时间；隐藏窗口 workshop smoke 验证获取纹理、提交和显示。'),P('Offscreen output checks do not prove resize, keyboard, touch or readability. Open the browser lab, change stages, reverse alpha order, scrub time, orbit, change language and inspect a narrow screen. A device/backend should be marked tested only when actual runtime evidence exists for it.','离屏检查不能证明 resize、键盘、触摸或可读性。还要打开浏览器实验，切换阶段、反转 alpha 顺序、拖动时间、绕转、切换语言并检查窄屏。只有实际运行证据，才把某设备或后端标为已验证。')]),
 S(B('3. Ship code and assets as one compatible version','3. 将代码与资产作为兼容版本发布'),[P('Build the WASM binary after Rust/WGSL changes, generate the blog and code snapshots, run checks, inspect the deployment bundle, then deploy. The JS glue and WASM binary must use the same versioned URL suffix because the package directory is cached. A stale glue module can make a correct new binary fail to load.','Rust/WGSL 修改后先构建 WASM，再生成博客及源码快照、运行检查、检查部署包，然后发布。JS 胶水与 WASM 二进制要用相同版本 URL 后缀，因为 package 目录有缓存。旧胶水模块可能导致正确的新二进制无法加载。'),P('After deployment, open the public build series and lab, not just the deployment log. Preserve the commit identifier and validation report so another person can reproduce the exact state. Deploying a page is not evidence that macOS or Linux has been tested.','部署后要打开公开工程系列和实验，不只看部署日志。保存提交编号与验证报告，让他人能够复现准确状态。页面部署成功不代表已经测试过 macOS 或 Linux。')]),
 S(B('4. Give a five-minute engineering walkthrough','4. 做一次五分钟工程讲解'),[P('Minute 1: draw browser/native → shared pass → pixels. Minute 2: decode one model record and explain activations. Minute 3: project one Gaussian and compose two overlaps. Minute 4: explain normalized time, sorting and the training/runtime boundary. Minute 5: show a failure you can diagnose, a measured bottleneck and a platform still unverified.','第 1 分钟：画出浏览器/桌面 → 共享 pass → 像素。第 2 分钟：解码一条模型记录，解释激活。第 3 分钟：投影一个 Gaussian、合成两个重叠点。第 4 分钟：讲归一化时间、排序与训练/运行时边界。第 5 分钟：展示能诊断的错误、测出的瓶颈，以及还没验证的平台。'),P('For the final exercise, integrate StgPass into your engine’s existing frame graph. Document coordinate and color conventions, show mesh occlusion with depth writes disabled for splats, and produce the same camera/time screenshot in browser and native. Treat unsupported models and device loss as explicit follow-up work.','最终练习是把 StgPass 接入自研引擎现有帧图。记录坐标和色彩约定，展示关闭 splat 深度写入后的 mesh 遮挡，并在浏览器和桌面生成同相机、同时间截图。未支持的模型与设备丢失恢复应明确列为后续工作。')])],
 commands:'npm run check\ncargo check --locked --examples\ncargo run --locked --example workshop_pixels\ncargo run --locked --example workshop -- --smoke\ncargo run --locked --example native_smoke\ncargo run --locked --example mini_compute\nnpx wrangler deploy --config wrangler.jsonc --dry-run\n# Deploy to your configured account/domain only after reviewing the bundle.\nnpm run deploy',
 expected:B('A reproducible set of pixel reports and images, a working browser/native demo, and an honest list of validated platforms and remaining integration work.','一组可复现的像素报告与图像、能运行的浏览器/桌面演示，以及准确的已验证平台和剩余集成工作清单。'),
 code:[C('src/workshop_surface.rs','frame',B('You can now explain every operation in the frame that seemed opaque in chapter 1.','现在你应该能解释第一章里还陌生的每个帧操作。'))],
 task:B('Explain why a successful WASM compilation, a native pixel test and a mobile browser interaction test are three different pieces of evidence.','解释为什么 WASM 编译成功、桌面像素测试通过和手机浏览器交互测试通过，是三种不同证据。'),
 answer:B('Compilation checks APIs and types; the native GPU test checks one backend’s rendered values; browser interaction checks hosting and user behavior in that environment. None alone establishes all-platform correctness or production performance.','编译检查 API 与类型，桌面 GPU 测试检查某后端的渲染数值，浏览器交互检查该环境中的宿主与操作行为。任何一项都不能单独证明所有平台正确或达到生产性能。'),refs:['wgpu','gpu'],math:'/learn/12-build-and-explain/'
}
];

